<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian Coffee Temperature and Rain.</title>
<headline>Brazilian Coffee Temperature and Rain.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Coffee Region Temperatures (Centigrade) and Rain (Millimetrs) in the Last 24 Hours to 1200 GMT Today. Parana State: Londrina 14.8, Nil, Maringa 17.2, Nil, Paranavai Not Available,, Umuarama 19.0, Nil. Sao Paulo State: Presidente Prudente 18.4, Nil, Franca 14.7, Nil, Votuporanga 17.7, Nil, Catanduva 17.8, Nil, Sao Carlos 14.7, Nil, Sao Simao 14.1, Nil.</p>
<p>Minas Gerais State: Pocos de Caldas 11.0, Nil, Guaxupe 13.2, Nil.</p>
</text>
